            "line": 534,
            "text": "theorem physical_swirl_value {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2)\n    {p : SimilarityProfile.PhysicalPoint} (hp : p.1 < 1) :\n    Real.sqrt (2 * p.2.1) * swirlProfile P h p = pullback h (-A h) P.E p"
